<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:3rem;">
    <div class="legal-content">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p style="color:#776;">
        This is a courtesy translation. The <a href="/datenschutz/">German version</a>
        is legally binding and takes precedence in case of any discrepancy.
      </p>

      <h2>1. General Information</h2>
      <p>
        Protecting your personal data is important to us. Below we inform you
        which data is processed when you visit our website and for what
        purpose.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Controller</h2>
      <p>
        Villa Rosengarten<br />
        rosengarten.casa
      </p>
      <p>
        Beate and Jens Petersen<br />
        Kanalstraße 16a<br />
        22085 Hamburg, Germany
      </p>
      <p>
        Email: <a href="mailto:info@rosengarten.casa">info@rosengarten.casa</a>
      </p>

      <h2>3. Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        Our website is operated by an external hosting provider. In this
        context, personal data that is automatically collected when visiting
        the website is processed, in particular:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>IP address</li>
        <li>Date and time of access</li>
        <li>Browser type and operating system</li>
        <li>Referrer URL</li>
        <li>Pages accessed</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        This processing is based on Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR, for the technically
        secure provision of the website.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you contact us by email or contact form, the data you provide will
        be stored in order to process your inquiry.
      </p>
      <p>
        Processing is based on Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR and/or Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Smoobu Booking System</h2>
      <p>We use the Smoobu booking system for online bookings.</p>
      <p>
        Provider:<br />
        Smoobu GmbH<br />
        Pappelallee 78/79<br />
        10437 Berlin, Germany
      </p>
      <p>
        When using the booking system, personal data such as name, contact
        details, booking data and payment information is processed.
      </p>
      <p>
        More information:
        <a href="https://www.smoobu.com/de/datenschutz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.smoobu.com/de/datenschutz/</a>
      </p>

      <h2>6. Embedding YouTube</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may embed videos from the YouTube platform.
      </p>
      <p>
        Provider:<br />
        Google Ireland Limited<br />
        Gordon House, Barrow Street<br />
        Dublin 4, Ireland
      </p>
      <p>
        When playing a video, personal data may be transmitted to Google.
      </p>
      <p>
        More information:
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a>
      </p>

      <h2>7. Google Maps and 360° Views</h2>
      <p>
        This website uses Google Maps and embedded 360° views to display our
        location and virtual tours.
      </p>
      <p>Provider: Google Ireland Limited</p>
      <p>
        When calling up the maps or 360° views, personal data may be
        processed.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Google Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This website uses – only with your prior consent via the cookie
        banner – the web analytics service Google Analytics (GA4).
      </p>
      <p>
        Provider:<br />
        Google Ireland Limited<br />
        Gordon House, Barrow Street<br />
        Dublin 4, Ireland
      </p>
      <p>
        Google Analytics uses cookies and similar technologies that enable an
        analysis of how our website is used (e.g. pages visited, time spent,
        device used). The information generated is transmitted to Google and
        processed there, including in the USA.
      </p>
      <p>
        Processing takes place exclusively on the basis of your consent
        pursuant to Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR, § 25(1) TTDSG. You can withdraw your
        consent at any time via the "Cookie settings" link in the footer;
        Google Analytics will then no longer be loaded on your next page
        visit.
      </p>
      <p>
        More information:
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a>
      </p>

      <h2>9. Spam Protection via Cloudflare Turnstile</h2>
      <p>
        To protect our contact form from automated spam submissions, we use
        the "Turnstile" service by Cloudflare.
      </p>
      <p>
        Provider:<br />
        Cloudflare, Inc.<br />
        101 Townsend St.<br />
        San Francisco, CA 94107, USA
      </p>
      <p>
        Turnstile analyses technical characteristics in the background to
        distinguish automated form submissions from genuine inquiries,
        without requiring an image puzzle to be solved. Personal data such as
        the IP address may be transmitted to Cloudflare in the process.
      </p>
      <p>
        Processing is based on our legitimate interest in a functional,
        spam-free contact form pursuant to Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR.
      </p>
      <p>
        More information:
        <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/</a>
      </p>

      <h2>10. Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Our website uses cookies. Technically necessary cookies are used
        without separate consent (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Cookies for Google
        Analytics are only set if you have explicitly agreed to this in the
        cookie banner.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can change or withdraw your consent at any time via the "Cookie
        settings" link in the footer.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access pursuant to Art. 15 GDPR</li>
        <li>Rectification pursuant to Art. 16 GDPR</li>
        <li>Erasure pursuant to Art. 17 GDPR</li>
        <li>Restriction of processing pursuant to Art. 18 GDPR</li>
        <li>Data portability pursuant to Art. 20 GDPR</li>
        <li>Object to processing pursuant to Art. 21 GDPR</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection
        supervisory authority.
      </p>

      <h2>12. SSL/TLS Encryption</h2>
      <p>
        For security reasons, this website uses SSL/TLS encryption.
      </p>

      <h2>13. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to amend this privacy policy so that it always
        complies with current legal requirements.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
